{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:98f819c40164312667be8a325bb3402ea98a25a000f736d2ec368552cb6e8632",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efde0203f179b841e420acb91c95818ecf0df39de8f211e9d17edc3226de1abb",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n刚才发生了一件让人吃惊的事哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15f5ae9ae3e38daf5af8ec033d961d7fedf1187d1b62cfc0f0f30826d956e2cb",
      "text": "我在车站前遇到了前几天我们开live的那所大学的teacher哦。\n超级巧的对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd5add9596950fc33cf9b97298da6881d50c94e520e1fbeae3afdc091594a429",
      "text": "我跟他打招呼，他有点不好意思地说，\n“当时对你们说了失礼的话”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e523abd4189d359237b9e53b6a996957d4c0e34352ece0999092541b411a92b5",
      "text": "然后他还对我说：“原来偶像也能给\n人生带来学习的启发啊……”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a2b857fde0edaf64fc9673c0cf3823cb6835781d8a89ff29caa80f305ac2e5",
      "text": "听说他也非常enjoy我们的live哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2e960e5fd91f308549877f2288c4d93d7de514df33ba853551947cb76a749be",
      "text": "大家的想法传达给他了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b446879fdcc5c706a53643cd716134ce725fff7d5e8dbd0249dffde61bc903dc",
      "text": "要是这样就太好啦～。之后我们熟络起来，\n他还跟我聊了好多大学的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac4c507ca3f05c3f03ae322cff5917ada3a298a982a81ed53d20f96244ad193f",
      "text": "其中特别有意思的是……啊。\n不好意思，lesson差不多要开始了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:036rui_306_2_3_036_06_09_a:2_3_036_06_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0004209483a8d09c7631c0a693c62cea3d4ffb28648a2f06aeadf770547f5c0",
      "text": "等有空的时候我再慢慢跟你说哦。\n拜拜啦，●●●●プロデューサー酱☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
